            {
              "text": "Nothing could change the fact that his favorite stick was gone.",
              "audioStart": 105.037,
              "audioEnd": 108.062
            },
            {
              "text": "He walked back to his house with a very tired body.",
              "audioStart": 108.925,
              "audioEnd": 111.65
            },
            {
              "text": "The evening came quickly, bringing a sense of relief to him.",
              "audioStart": 112.513,
              "audioEnd": 115.638
            },
            {
              "text": "He sat by the warm fire and dried his wet clothes.",
              "audioStart": 116.5,
              "audioEnd": 119.35
            },
            {
              "text": "Dinner was simple because he had caught nothing during the trip.",
              "audioStart": 120.213,
              "audioEnd": 123.037
            },
            {
              "text": "He promised himself that he would be much more careful next time.",
              "audioStart": 123.9,
              "audioEnd": 127.125
            },
            {
              "text": "Life by the water was full of strange events.",
              "audioStart": 127.987,
              "audioEnd": 130.275
            },
            {
              "text": "He loved his little home, despite the recent trouble.",
              "audioStart": 131.137,
              "audioEnd": 133.963
            },
            {
              "text": "Tomorrow would bring another chance to do things differently.",
              "audioStart": 134.825,
              "audioEnd": 137.575
            },
            {
              "text": "For now, rest was the only thing that mattered to him.",
              "audioStart": 138.438,
              "audioEnd": 141.3
            },
            {
              "text": "He closed his eyes and fell into a deep sleep.",
              "audioStart": 142.162,
              "audioEnd": 144.637
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "The man woke up early the next morning.",
              "audioStart": 145.5,
              "audioEnd": 147.5
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun was shining brightly across the calm water.",
              "audioStart": 148.363,
              "audioEnd": 150.925
            },
            {
              "text": "He walked out of his house and looked toward the lake.",
              "audioStart": 151.787,
              "audioEnd": 154.262
            },
            {
              "text": "Everything looked quiet, as if nothing bad had happened.",
              "audioStart": 155.125,
              "audioEnd": 158.162
            },
            {
              "text": "He remembered the big fish that had pulled him under.",
              "audioStart": 159.025,
              "audioEnd": 161.475
            },
            {
              "text": "A small smile appeared on his face despite the memory.",
              "audioStart": 162.338,
              "audioEnd": 165.137
            },
            {
              "text": "He decided to make a cup of hot tea instead of fishing.",
              "audioStart": 166,
              "audioEnd": 169.025
            },
            {
              "text": "While he drank his tea, he read a book by the window.",
              "audioStart": 169.887,
              "audioEnd": 172.713
            },
            {
              "text": "The book was about animals that lived near the water.",
              "audioStart": 173.575,
              "audioEnd": 176.025
            },
            {
              "text": "He wondered if the same animal was still watching him.",
              "audioStart": 176.887,
              "audioEnd": 179.325
            },
            {
              "text": "Of course, he could not be sure about anything.",
              "audioStart": 180.188,
              "audioEnd": 182.7
            },
            {
              "text": "The morning air felt fresh and cool against his skin.",
              "audioStart": 183.562,
              "audioEnd": 186.4
            },
            {
              "text": "He felt grateful that he had survived the strange adventure.",
              "audioStart": 187.262,
              "audioEnd": 190.05
            },
            {
              "text": "If he went back to the lake, he would use better equipment.",
              "audioStart": 190.912,
              "audioEnd": 193.85
            },
            {
              "text": "His little house offered all the protection that he needed.",
              "audioStart": 194.713,
              "audioEnd": 197.4
            },
            {
              "text": "He spent the rest of the day cleaning his wet clothes.",
              "audioStart": 198.262,
              "audioEnd": 200.912
            },
            {
              "text": "By afternoon, he felt completely normal again.",
              "audioStart": 201.775,
              "audioEnd": 204.475
            },
            {
              "text": "The experience taught him a very important lesson.",
              "audioStart": 205.338,
              "audioEnd": 207.887
            },
            {
              "text": "Nature was powerful, and people had to respect it.",
              "audioStart": 208.75,
              "audioEnd": 211.688
            },
            {
              "text": "He would always remember the cold water and the dark clouds.",
              "audioStart": 212.55,
              "audioEnd": 215.475
            },
            {
              "text": "Even so, he still loved his quiet life by the lake.",
              "audioStart": 216.338,
              "audioEnd": 219.488
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun began to set, painting the sky in soft colors.",
              "audioStart": 220.35,
              "audioEnd": 223.713
            },
            {
              "text": "He closed his front door and prepared for another night.",
              "audioStart": 224.575,
              "audioEnd": 227.287
            },
            {
              "text": "The man knew that he was safe inside his home.",
              "audioStart": 228.15,
              "audioEnd": 230.512
            },
            {
              "text": "He looked forward to whatever the future might bring him.",
              "audioStart": 231.375,
              "audioEnd": 234
            },
            {
              "text": "He thought about the boat that had moved away.",
              "audioStart": 234.863,
              "audioEnd": 236.85
            },
            {
              "text": "He hoped that the boat was safe somewhere near land.",
              "audioStart": 237.713,
              "audioEnd": 240.162
            },
            {
              "text": "Perhaps a local person would bring it back to him.",
              "audioStart": 241.025,
              "audioEnd": 243.463
            },
            {
              "text": "The fire in the room burned with a bright light.",
              "audioStart": 244.325,
              "audioEnd": 246.675
            },
            {
              "text": "He ate some simple food and drank more hot tea.",
              "audioStart": 247.537,
              "audioEnd": 250.262
            },
            {
              "text": "His body felt tired from all the work in the water.",
              "audioStart": 251.125,
              "audioEnd": 253.762
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that he must rest for another big day.",
              "audioStart": 254.625,
              "audioEnd": 256.938
            },
            {
              "text": "The sound of the wind outside was very quiet now.",
              "audioStart": 257.8,
              "audioEnd": 260.288
            },
            {
              "text": "He checked his clothes to make sure they were dry.",
              "audioStart": 261.15,
              "audioEnd": 263.475
            },
            {
              "text": "Everything was in order inside his small living space.",
              "audioStart": 264.337,
              "audioEnd": 268.483
            },
            {
              "text": "He smiled again when he thought about his bed.",
              "audioStart": 269.346,
              "audioEnd": 271.546
            },
            {
              "text": "The night grew darker as the hours passed slowly.",
              "audioStart": 272.409,
              "audioEnd": 275.009
            },
            {
              "text": "He closed his eyes and slept until the morning came.",
              "audioStart": 275.871,
              "audioEnd": 278.558
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Many days passed after the strange event at the lake.",
              "audioStart": 279.421,
              "audioEnd": 282.221
            },
            {
              "text": "The man lived quietly and focused on small daily tasks.",
              "audioStart": 283.084,
              "audioEnd": 286.396
            },
            {
              "text": "He spent his mornings reading books and drinking hot tea.",
              "audioStart": 287.259,
              "audioEnd": 290.284
            },
            {
              "text": "Sometimes he walked near the edge of the water to watch the birds.",
              "audioStart": 291.146,
              "audioEnd": 294.334
            },
            {
              "text": "He always checked the sky before stepping outside his door.",
              "audioStart": 295.196,
              "audioEnd": 298.196
            },
            {
              "text": "The memory of the big fish remained fresh in his mind.",
              "audioStart": 299.058,
              "audioEnd": 301.796
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that nature demanded respect from every person.",
              "audioStart": 302.659,
              "audioEnd": 305.483
            },
            {
              "text": "His friends often visited him to talk about the old days.",
              "audioStart": 306.346,
              "audioEnd": 309.346
            },
            {
              "text": "They brought food and shared stories about local events.",
              "audioStart": 310.209,
              "audioEnd": 313.084
            },
            {
              "text": "He told them about the large animal in the deep water.",
              "audioStart": 313.946,
              "audioEnd": 316.521
            },
            {
              "text": "They listened with great interest and agreed with his caution.",
              "audioStart": 317.384,
              "audioEnd": 320.296
            },
            {
              "text": "Nobody wanted to face such danger during a simple trip.",
              "audioStart": 321.159,
              "audioEnd": 324.071
            },
            {
              "text": "He felt happy that he had survived the terrifying moment.",
              "audioStart": 324.933,
              "audioEnd": 327.784
            },
            {
              "text": "His little house provided a safe place from every storm.",
              "audioStart": 328.646,
              "audioEnd": 331.696
            },
            {
              "text": "The warm fire kept him comfortable during cold evenings.",
              "audioStart": 332.558,
              "audioEnd": 335.571
            },
            {
              "text": "He realized that life was precious and full of unexpected turns.",
              "audioStart": 336.433,
              "audioEnd": 340.046
            },
            {
              "text": "Every single night brought peace and deep rest to him.",
              "audioStart": 340.909,
              "audioEnd": 343.571
            },
            {
              "text": "He promised to keep his distance from the deep lake.",
              "audioStart": 344.433,
              "audioEnd": 347.009
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun rose again, bringing light to the beautiful world.",
              "audioStart": 347.871,
              "audioEnd": 350.858
            },
            {
              "text": "He smiled as he started another peaceful day at home.",
              "audioStart": 351.721,
              "audioEnd": 354.421
            }
